---
/** Automated Follow-up — the messages you would have sent, at the moment
    you would have sent them; a reply that needs a decision is flagged. */
---
<div class="mk-panel wide">
  <div class="mk-head"><b>Follow-ups</b><small>This week · 3 scheduled</small></div>
  <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk now"></span><div><b>Proposal nudge · Lena &amp; Mark</b><small>Opened 3 days ago, no answer · sends tomorrow 09:00</small></div><span class="mk-tag grey">Queued</span></div>
  <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk"></span><div><b>Voucher reminder · Atlas Maroc</b><small>5 days to departure · sent, voucher received</small></div><span class="mk-tag">Done</span></div>
  <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk now"></span><div><b>Feedback request · Sofia</b><small>Home 7 days · sends Friday</small></div><span class="mk-tag grey">Queued</span></div>
  <div class="mk-row plain" style="border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:0;padding-top:.8em"><div><b>"Could we push it a week later?"</b><small>Reply to a nudge · a change, so flagged to you</small></div><span class="mk-btn amb">Reply</span></div>
</div>
